		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Blue, cold-fleshed human- shaped demon woman with ram's horns, four arms, and a mouth that drips blood.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 16 (chain), <strong>HP</strong> 35, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 scimitar +4 (1d6 + blood heal) and 1 despairing gaze, <strong>MV</strong> double near, <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> +1, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 7</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Blood Heal</strong>. If seraptis wounds mortal, regains 1d6 HP as the spilled blood flows into the demon's mouth.</p><p></p><p><strong>Despairing Gaze</strong>. One mortal in near WIS 15+ or loses 1d4 CHA permanently. At 0 CHA, kills self.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
